Phase 1: Core Engine & API Releases (Weeks 1–4)
Week 1: v0.1 — Terminal CLI Tracker (10 hrs)

Ship: A working Python CLI tool using argparse or click and SQLite.

Deliverable: Command-line command to add habits, mark them done, and view a text table of today's progress.

Week 2: v0.2 — Quantitative Target Engine (10 hrs)

Ship: Core target tracking math engine.

Deliverable: Support for custom daily goals (e.g., target 3,000 mL, partial logs of +500 mL, percentage calculation).

Week 3: v0.3 — FastAPI REST Service (10 hrs)

Ship: A lightweight web backend.

Deliverable: FastAPI backend serving interactive Swagger docs at /docs with JSON endpoints for CRUD operations.

Week 4: v0.4 — Smart Streak Engine (10 hrs)

Ship: Advanced streak & grace period module.

Deliverable: Endpoints that compute current streak, longest streak, and support "Skip" or "Freeze" days without resetting counts.

Phase 2: Web Dashboard Releases (Weeks 5–8)
Week 5: v0.5 — Web Dashboard Base (10 hrs)

Ship: A minimal web interface connected to FastAPI.

Deliverable: HTML/JS dashboard where you can check off habits and view daily lists.

Week 6: v0.6 — Quantitative Logging UI (10 hrs)

Ship: High-touch visual controls.

Deliverable: Interactive progress bars, numeric input buttons (+250 mL, +500 mL), and instant UI updates.

Week 7: v0.7 — Heatmap Grid (10 hrs)

Ship: Visual history matrix.

Deliverable: GitHub-style green activity grid showing completion intensity over the last 90 days.

Week 8: v0.8 — Local-First Offline Mode (10 hrs)

Ship: Zero-latency offline functionality.

Deliverable: Web client that saves logs to localStorage when offline and syncs back to FastAPI when online.

Phase 3: Advanced Features & Terra Readiness (Weeks 9–12)
Week 9: v0.9 — Custom Day Boundary & Timezones (10 hrs)

Ship: Flexible daily cutoff engine.

Deliverable: Setting to allow late-night logs (e.g., up to 3:00 AM) to count toward the previous calendar day.

Week 10: v1.0 — Quantified Self Analytics (10 hrs)

Ship: Statistics engine and data exporter.

Deliverable: Reports tab calculating overall consistency %, weekly trends, and CSV/JSON export buttons.

Week 11: v1.1 — External Webhooks & API Integration (10 hrs)

Ship: Automation integration.

Deliverable: Webhook dispatcher that sends notifications or triggers external events when milestones (e.g., 7-day streak) are hit.

Week 12: v1.2 — Production Container & Final Release (10 hrs)

Ship: Production deployment package.

Deliverable: Docker image and single-line deployment script (docker-compose up) ready for hosting anywhere.